jobs.description:
Are you ready to apply your accounting skills in a challenging role within a growing and international environment? Do you enjoy ensuring financial records are accurate, compliant, and impeccably organized? 

We are looking for a Junior Accountant to join the finance team for a company in Leuven.

Your responsibilities will include:

AP accounting

• Register incoming invoices according to Belgian accounting and VAT principles and get them through
the approval cycle;
• Payments of suppliers and reconciliation of outgoing payments;
• Review and register expense notes.
General accounting

• Book and reconcile bank statements;
• Register journal entries;
• Register payroll bookings;
• Register fixed assets and book depreciations;
• Register prepaid expenses and provisions;
• Filing Belgian VAT returns;
• Register prepaid expenses and provisions.

• Bachelor in a relevant field (Finance, Accountancy) or assimilated by experience.
• Excellent knowledge of English and good knowledge of Dutch (spoken & written).
• Great attention to detail and good with numbers and figures and an analytical acumen.
• Good understanding of Belgian accounting and financial reporting principles and practices.
• Excellent knowledge of MS Office and familiarity with relevant computer software. Experience with NetSuite and/or Salesforce is a plus.
